---
description: ICUHUB repository rules (canonical source is AGENTS.md)
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` in the repository root. It is the canonical instruction file.

- Integration hub only: connectors, credentials, policy, approvals, audit, OCSF/SARIF.
- No AI/LLM code. No consumer imports. Never expose credentials.
- One pipeline for every external call. Plain dict connector registry. Small protocols.
- Every operation: classification + egress class + schemas.
- Do not resolve open decisions (BRD section 18) or add dependencies outside accepted ADRs without the operator.
